# The Remotion edit is source-only in git. Whisper is a separate upstream clone, and the
# capture footage, licensed music bed, voiceover, and standin frames are heavy local media
# that the finished film on YouTube already carries. Same rule as assets/ and exports/ above.
edit/whisper.cpp/
edit/public/footage/
edit/public/audio/
edit/public/voiceover/
edit/public/standin/

exports/devpost/
